msgid "UBlox GPS Configuration"
msgstr "UBlox GPS 配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ublox-gps.rst:7 021dc9edb1e84fa08bbc7fc6c1136703
#: 318e69a97a9b4a91b88eb0dc32b1fc73 4a8b3f011f364453b2320efa1d7020f0
#: ac9503c7da1747b5b8a3fafff7d9e621 b0af8ac90216456585d85a80b62c012d
msgid ""
"This article explains how to connect to u-center to change the configuration"
" of a :ref:`3DR uBlox <common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module>` "
"module. This is not expected to be necessary for normal users."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何连接 u-center 以更改 :ref:`3DR uBlox <common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-"
"compass-module>` 模块的配置。普通用户通常无需此操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ublox-gps.rst:14 4a681bf6fa7645afbb7241ee9ada5e90
#: 5b55bbe6a9f245a6b8a9d22ea03aeb72 7ab5fd9e9bf64d6283d7678dbe9535ab
#: 7dbf2ffba1ad414c9468d712a5a5fef5 b130498fd9054c5aadbc3cfb2c6af989
msgid "Connection Option #1 - Mission Planner and Pixhawk as Passthrough"
msgstr "连接方式 #1 - Mission Planner 和 Pixhawk 作为透传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ublox-gps.rst:16 24c5b879edb04499a897ecf4435d9ead
#: d07f4b64c6414d05b28e57050cae9ff9 d1f16a1154a14888b6223ccbd358e6e9
#: f7cd6bb954ad4d7d878609dc46ab1223 fcee83e1854345d0a2ca5e1cf96a959a
msgid ""
"Mission planner and pixhawk can pass through the communication between "
"u-center and the GPS by doing the following:"
msgstr "Mission Planner 和 Pixhawk 可以通过以下方式透传 u-center 与 GPS 之间的通信："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ublox-gps.rst:19 0b7fc615bf8f4cd3a38506dd9152117a
#: 1212fd729ee84b6382211cea81a78b7e 44d015b7540642b8be15399eecdc65a0
#: 4a2841c46fb84e7f859af58a89eead7d b62d6e001c2d4acfa37c3af3f1940da3
msgid "Connect Pixhawk to your PC and connect with the Mission Planner"
msgstr "将 Pixhawk 连接到电脑并通过 Mission Planner 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ublox-gps.rst:20 1ede885c823346ae86f3b237b91b2e35
#: 44bd0e7af4b0492ca895d3a01b124e17 a3be47d880c8499a84d3f086055bf8a3
#: c2ba75e69644442fbfbdee518681f028 cddc8d5f738c416686cc43d8c5d23644
msgid "On the Flight Data screen press Ctrl-F and then select \"MAVSerial pass\""
msgstr "在飞行数据界面按 Ctrl-F，然后选择「MAVSerial pass」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ublox-gps.rst:21 3e947fb078954a6c8c86e60bbdc46429
#: 6c1513065b5a497680f67df7832fcd37 989d736f8339401e97e9386b28ae03eb
#: df1ed5ad5a9f404ba80e5474b8acfada ef45fc19b1a04381920a676f52448f0c
msgid ""
"Open u-center and select Receiver, TCP Client and in the Network Connection "
"window set Address to \"localhost\" and Port to \"500\" and press OK."
msgstr ""
"打开 u-center，选择 Receiver、TCP Client，在 Network Connection 窗口中将 Address "
"设为「localhost」，Port 设为「500」，然后点击 OK。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ublox-gps.rst:23 662ac8e05e3c47a198e0e18f87479667
#: 6afde441a6884575bdd29e95f9c78e4d 752226f05ee6454abcf8b3828f346ad0
#: 7e0f7e2925d94ae0949a1dca417ee718 9de855d683f0431aaf923673e9705e12
msgid "See instructions below as to how to upload config with u-center."
msgstr "请参阅以下关于如何使用 u-center 上传配置的说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ublox-gps.rst:32 29ef2de7e3c347689fb4ea6ca2196990
#: 574c90837f4c4c3b83f4e3b9f4ab74b1 a6dd61cf3185444dab4b0e76a85203e1
#: bbd92131a90d46959527083d41fe16ae e0e2b2fbfe7a452c946165920752d034
msgid "Connection Option #2 - FTDI cable"
msgstr "连接方式 #2 - FTDI 线"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ublox-gps.rst:34 2895c20435464cf3a51bfe271742fbb8
#: 6facf76738154118b8ce72fc63901ecd 8cb7a5525fcf4011b1757e3d563397b4
#: a3796ca48ad04ddfbf0dcdda06e234a8 ef2b4d87a7eb4a9596b23212d2e44367
msgid ""
"You will need an `FTDI cable <https://www.amazon.com/ftdi-"
"adapter/s?k=ftdi+adapter>`__ and a `GPS adapter cable "
"<http://store.scoutuav.com/product/cables-connectors/gps-cable-10-cm/>`__ to"
" connect the GPS to your computer. If you have never plugged an FTDI device "
"into your computer, you may need to download and install the `Virtual COM "
"port driver <http://www.ftdichip.com/Drivers/VCP.htm>`__."
msgstr ""
"您需要一根 `FTDI 线 <https://www.amazon.com/ftdi-adapter/s?k=ftdi+adapter>`__ 和一根 "
"`GPS 适配线 <http://store.scoutuav.com/product/cables-connectors/gps-"
"cable-10-cm/>`__ 将 GPS 连接到电脑。如果您从未将 FTDI 设备插入电脑，可能需要下载并安装 `Virtual COM port "
"驱动程序 <http://www.ftdichip.com/Drivers/VCP.htm>`__。"
